aug-1812-6:85:{"output":"Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /root/luuniensuki-lms/CLAUDE.md:\n     1\t# CLAUDE.md\n     2\t\n     3\tThis file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.\n     4\t\n     5\t## Project Overview\n     6\t\n     7\tLuuniensuki LMS is a gamified learning platform for Vietnamese cultural heritage education, focused on the \"Cửu Đỉnh\" (Nine Urns) of the Nguyen Dynasty. Users explore 3D urn models, discover motifs (decorative patterns), complete lessons, and take quizzes to earn XP and badges.\n     8\t\n     9\t## Tech Stack\n    10\t\n    11\t- **Backend**: Python 3.12, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.x, PostgreSQL 15, Alembic migrations\n    12\t- **Frontend**: Next.js 15, React 19, Three.js/React Three Fiber, Zustand, TailwindCSS\n    13\t- **Infrastructure**: Docker Compose, Nginx reverse proxy\n    14\t\n    15\t## Common Commands\n    16\t\n    17\t### Backend\n    18\t```bash\n    19\t# Run tests (requires test DB: luuniensuki_test)\n    20\tDATABASE_URL=\"postgresql+psycopg://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/luuniensuki_test\" pytest tests/backend -v\n    21\t\n    22\t# Run single test\n    23\tpytest tests/backend/test_auth.py::test_register -v\n    24\t\n    25\t# Seed database\n    26\tpython -m backend.seed --seed-path data --image-path ban-duc-noi\n    27\t\n    28\t# Run migrations\n    29\talembic upgrade head\n    30\t```\n    31\t\n    32\t### Frontend\n    33\t```bash\n    34\tcd frontend\n    35\tnpm run dev      # Development server on port 3000\n    36\tnpm run build    # Production build\n    37\tnpm run lint     # ESLint\n    38\tnpx playwright test  # E2E tests\n    39\t```\n    40\t\n    41\t### Docker\n    42\t```bash\n    43\tdocker compose up -d              # Start all services\n    44\tdocker compose exec api pytest    # Run tests in container\n    45\t```\n    46\t\n    47\t## Architecture\n    48\t\n    49\t### Backend Structure\n    50\t- `backend/main.py` - FastAPI app with all API endpoints (monolithic, ~1500 lines)\n    51\t- `backend/models.py` - SQLAlchemy ORM models (User, Urn, Motif, LessonContent, UserProgress, QuizQuestion, Badge, etc.)\n    52\t- `backend/errors.py` - Custom AppError exception with structured JSON responses\n    53\t- `backend/seed.py` - Database seeder from JSON/Markdown files in `data/`\n    54\t- `backend/security.py` - JWT token creation and password hashing\n    55\t\n    56\t### Frontend Structure\n    57\t- `frontend/src/stores/` - Zustand stores (authStore, motifStore) with localStorage persistence\n    58\t- `frontend/src/lib/api.js` - API client functions\n    59\t- `frontend/src/components/UrnViewer.js` - 3D urn viewer with Three.js, hotspot interaction\n    60\t- `frontend/src/components/FloatingNavbar.jsx` - Bottom floating navigation with i18n (vi/en), user dropdown, language switcher\n    61\t- `frontend/src/components/OnboardingModal.jsx` - First-time user onboarding wizard\n    62\t- `frontend/src/components/AuthGate.jsx` - Authentication wrapper, redirects unauthenticated users to login\n    63\t- `frontend/src/app/` - Next.js App Router pages\n    64\t\n    65\t### Key Data Flow\n    66\t1. User clicks hotspot sphere on 3D urn → `unlockFromClick()` in motifStore\n    67\t2. POST `/progress/unlock` → creates/updates UserProgress, awards XP, checks badges\n    68\t3. Response updates Zustand store → UI reflects discovered status\n    69\t\n    70\t## Domain-Specific Logic\n    71\t\n    72\t### XP System\n    73\t- Discovery: 25 XP, Lesson: 50 XP, Mastered (quiz pass): 75 XP\n    74\t- Quiz pass threshold: 80%\n    75\t- XP ranks defined in `XP_RANKS` array (Vietnamese titles: Lính Mới → Sử Quan)\n    76\t\n    77\t### Unlock Status Flow\n    78\t`hidden` → `discovered` (tap hotspot) → `learned` (complete lesson) → `mastered` (pass quiz)\n    79\t\n    80\t### Badge Awards\n    81\tBadges are awarded automatically in `_award_badge()` during unlock/lesson/quiz actions:\n    82\t- `first-discovery`, `first-mastered`, `streak-7`, `collector-10/50`, `explorer-all-urns`, `quiz-master`, `speed-demon`, `perfect-score`\n    83\t\n    84\t### Motif Positioning\n    85\t- Motifs have `pos_x/y/z` and `bounding_radius` for 3D hotspot placement\n    86\t- If positions are (0,0,0), UrnViewer falls back to circular arrangement formula\n    87\t- `tap_position` validation was removed - users click directly on positioned hotspot spheres\n    88\t\n    89\t### Lesson Content Structure\n    90\t- Fields: `intro_text`, `description`, `historical_context`, `symbolism`, `fun_fact`\n    91\t- Recommended display order: Intro → Description → Symbolism → Historical Context → Fun Fact\n    92\t- Vietnamese section headers: Giới thiệu, Mô tả chi tiết, Ý nghĩa biểu tượng, Bối cảnh lịch sử, Điều thú vị\n    93\t\n    94\t### Seed Data\n    95\t- JSON files in `data/` contain motif definitions with Vietnamese/English names, categories, lessons, quiz questions\n    96\t- Images in `ban-duc-noi/` are matched to motifs via slug fuzzy matching\n    97\t- `IMAGE_SLUG_ALIASES` handles known naming mismatches\n    98\t\n    99\t## API Patterns\n   100\t\n   101\t### Error Response Format\n   102\tAll errors return structured JSON:\n   103\t```json\n   104\t{\"error\": {\"code\": \"ERROR_CODE\", \"message\": \"Human message\", \"details\": {}}}\n   105\t```\n   106\t\n   107\t### Authentication\n   108\t- JWT tokens with `type: \"access\"` or `type: \"refresh\"`\n   109\t- OAuth2PasswordBearer scheme, token in Authorization header\n   110\t- Guest users (`role: \"guest\"`) can only access `is_demo: true` motifs\n   111\t- Access token expires in 60 minutes, refresh token in 30 days\n   112\t\n   113\t## Testing\n   114\t\n   115\t### Backend Tests\n   116\t- Use `conftest.py` fixtures: `db_session` (transactional), `client` (TestClient), `seeded_content`\n   117\t- Tests run in transaction that rolls back after each test\n   118\t- Test DB must exist: `luuniensuki_test`\n   119\t\n   120\t### E2E Tests\n   121\t- Playwright tests in `frontend/e2e/`\n   122\t- Requires frontend dev server running on port 3000\n   123\t\n   124\t## Special Logic & Edge Cases\n   125\t\n   126\t### AuthGate & Hydration Pattern\n   127\t- `AuthGate` component wraps all pages in `layout.jsx`\n   128\t- Public paths: `/login`, `/register` (defined in `PUBLIC_PATH_PREFIXES`)\n   129\t- Must wait for Zustand persist hydration before checking auth state\n   130\t- Uses `useAuthStore.persist.onFinishHydration()` callback\n   131\t- Wrapped in `<Suspense>` to avoid Next.js static generation errors with `useSearchParams()`\n   132\t- Unauthenticated users redirected to `/login?returnUrl=<original-path>`\n   133\t\n   134\t### Zustand Store Persistence\n   135\t- `authStore`: persists `accessToken`, `refreshToken` to localStorage key `luuniensuki-auth`\n   136\t- `motifStore`: persists `foundByMotifId`, `progressByMotifId` to localStorage key `luuniensuki-motif-progress`\n   137\t- Both use `createJSONStorage(() => localStorage)` with version tracking\n   138\t\n   139\t### Badge Award System\n   140\t- Badges are checked and awarded in `_award_badge()` function in `backend/main.py`\n   141\t- Badge slugs: `first-discovery`, `first-mastered`, `streak-7`, `collector-10`, `collector-50`, `explorer-all-urns`, `quiz-master`, `speed-demon`, `perfect-score`\n   142\t- Badge awards are idempotent - checks for existing UserBadge before creating\n   143\t- Badge XP bonus is added to user's total_xp immediately upon award\n   144\t- Badge checks happen during: unlock, complete-lesson, and quiz submission\n   145\t\n   146\t### Streak System\n   147\t- `_update_streak()` function updates user's current_streak and longest_streak\n   148\t- Streak increments if last_active_at was exactly 1 day ago\n   149\t- Streak resets to 1 if gap is > 1 day\n   150\t- Streak freeze feature allows users to protect their streak (uses `streak_freezes` counter)\n   151\t- Streak freeze sets `last_active_at` to yesterday to preserve streak continuity\n   152\t- Streak is updated on any progress action (unlock, lesson, quiz)\n   153\t\n   154\t### XP Award Logic\n   155\t- XP is awarded incrementally: DISCOVERY_XP (25) → LESSON_XP (50) → MASTERED_XP (75)\n   156\t- Each motif tracks `xp_earned` to prevent duplicate awards\n   157\t- If user already has partial XP, only the delta is awarded\n   158\t- Badge XP bonuses are added on top of base XP\n   159\t- Total XP determines user rank (Vietnamese titles from \"Lính Mới\" to \"Sử Quan\")\n   160\t\n   161\t### Race Condition Handling\n   162\t- `unlock_progress()` and `complete_lesson()` have IntegrityError retry blocks\n   163\t- On IntegrityError: rollback → re-fetch progress → re-apply updates → commit\n   164\t- This handles concurrent requests from same user (e.g., double-click on mobile)\n   165\t- Badge awards are recalculated in retry block to ensure consistency\n   166\t\n   167\t### Motif Discovery Counting\n   168\t- `_count_user_discoveries()` counts motifs with status != hidden\n   169\t- Used for collector badges (10, 50 discoveries)\n   170\t- Also tracks unique urns discovered for explorer-all-urns badge (requires 9 urns)\n   171\t- Counts are computed during unlock to check badge thresholds\n   172\t\n   173\t### Quiz Scoring\n   174\t- Quiz pass threshold: 80% (QUIZ_PASS_PERCENT constant)\n   175\t- Score calculation: exact string match between submitted answer and correct_answer (both stripped)\n   176\t- Percentage rounded to nearest integer\n   177\t- Quiz attempts are always recorded in QuizAttempt table, even if failed\n   178\t- Best score is tracked in UserProgress.quiz_best_score\n   179\t- `speed-demon` badge: complete quiz in ≤30 seconds\n   180\t- `quiz-master` badge: 10 perfect (100%) quiz scores\n   181\t\n   182\t### Guest User Restrictions\n   183\t- Guest users (role=\"guest\") can only access motifs/urns with `is_demo=true`\n   184\t- Enforced in unlock_progress, complete_lesson, and quiz endpoints\n   185\t- Returns 403 Forbidden if guest tries to access non-demo content\n   186\t\n   187\t### Hotspot Positioning Logic\n   188\t- Motifs have `pos_x`, `pos_y`, `pos_z`, `bounding_radius` fields\n   189\t- If all positions are (0,0,0), UrnViewer uses circular arrangement fallback\n   190\t- Hotspot spheres are rendered at exact motif positions\n   191\t- `tap_position` validation was removed - users click directly on hotspot spheres\n   192\t- Hotspot radius scales with `bounding_radius` (min 0.08, default 0.12)\n   193\t\n   194\t### Image Resolution & Fuzzy Matching\n   195\t- `scan_images()` in seed.py scans `ban-duc-noi/` directory structure\n   196\t- Images matched to motifs via slugified names\n   197\t- `IMAGE_SLUG_ALIASES` dict handles known mismatches (e.g., \"ngu-tinh\" → \"moc-tinh-hoa-tinh...\")\n   198\t- Fuzzy matching uses `difflib.get_close_matches()` with 0.85 cutoff\n   199\t- If multiple matches, requires 0.05 ratio difference to auto-select\n   200\t\n   201\t### Enum Coercion in Seed Data\n   202\t- `coerce_enum()` handles various input formats: kebab-case, snake_case, spaces\n   203\t- Tries: raw value → normalized (replace - and space with _) → slugified\n   204\t- Falls back to default if no match found\n   205\t- Used for MotifCategory, MotifRarity, QuestionType enums\n   206\t\n   207\t### Vietnamese Text Handling\n   208\t- `slugify()` function: NFKD normalization → remove combining chars → đ→d → lowercase → replace non-alphanumeric with -\n   209\t- Motif names stored in both Vietnamese (`name`) and English (`name_en`)\n   210\t- UI primarily Vietnamese with i18n support in FloatingNavbar\n   211\t\n   212\t### API Client Error Handling\n   213\t- `apiRequest()` in `frontend/src/lib/api.js` extracts error messages from structured JSON responses\n   214\t- Checks `data.error.message` first, then `data.detail`\n   215\t- Falls back to HTTP status text if JSON parsing fails\n   216\t\n   217\t### FloatingNavbar i18n Pattern\n   218\t- Translations object with `vi` and `en` keys\n   219\t- `t(key)` function returns translated string\n   220\t- Language state persisted in component, not global store\n   221\t- User dropdown shows avatar (or initial), display name, logout button\n   222\t\n   223\t### Onboarding System\n   224\t- `OnboardingModal` checks localStorage key `hasSeenOnboarding`\n   225\t- 4-step wizard: Welcome, 3D Exploration, Learning Flow, Gamification\n   226\t- First-time tooltips in UrnViewer check `hasSeenViewerTips`\n   227\t\n   228\t### Password Security\n   229\t- bcrypt with 12 rounds for hashing\n   230\t- Maximum password length: 72 bytes (bcrypt limitation)\n   231\t- Passwords exceeding limit rejected at hash time, return false at verify time\n   232\t\n   233\t## Recent Bug Fixes & Updates\n   234\t\n   235\t### Image Loading Issue (FIXED - 2025-12-18)\n   236\t- **Problem**: All thumbnails (urns/motifs) returned 404\n   237\t- **Root cause**: `docker-compose.yml` had wrong volume mount: `/var/www/assets:/var/www/assets:ro` (host path empty)\n   238\t- **Solution**: Changed to `./ban-duc-noi:/var/www/assets/ban-duc-noi:ro` to match production config\n   239\t- **Files changed**: `docker-compose.yml` line 56\n   240\t- **Note**: After changing volume mounts, must run `docker compose down nginx && docker compose up -d nginx`\n   241\t\n   242\t### 3D Viewer Height Issue (FIXED - 2025-12-18)\n   243\t- **Problem**: 3D viewer on `/urns/[urnSlug]` not full height (80px gap at bottom), FloatingNavbar overlapping 3D content\n   244\t- **Root cause**: `UrnExperience` uses `fixed inset-0` positioning which ignores parent padding. FloatingNavbar (80px height) was covering bottom of 3D viewer\n   245\t- **Solution**: Added `pb-20` directly to `UrnExperience` container div (line 64)\n   246\t- **Files changed**:\n   247\t  - `frontend/src/components/UrnExperience.js` - changed `className=\"fixed inset-0 w-full overflow-hidden bg-black\"` to include `pb-20`\n   248\t- **Pattern**: Fixed-positioned elements need their own padding/margin, cannot inherit from parent layout\n   249\t\n   250\t### UX Improvements (2025-12-18)\n   251\t\n   252\t#### Navigation Simplification\n   253\t- **Change**: Reduced FloatingNavbar from 6 to 4 items\n   254\t- **New structure**: Khám Phá (Explore), Bộ Sưu Tập (Collection), Thành Tích (Achievements), Hồ Sơ (Profile)\n   255\t- **Files changed**: `frontend/src/components/FloatingNavbar.jsx`\n   256\t- **Rationale**: Reduce navigation overload, combine related features\n   257\t\n   258\t#### Achievements Page\n   259\t- **Change**: Created `/achievements` page combining badges + leaderboard with tab navigation\n   260\t- **Features**: Tab switching between badges and leaderboard, responsive grid layout\n   261\t- **Files added**: `frontend/src/app/achievements/page.jsx`\n   262\t- **Rationale**: Consolidate achievement-related features in one place\n   263\t\n   264\t#### Dashboard → Profile Rename\n   265\t- **Change**: Renamed `/dashboard` to `/profile`, added redirect from old URL\n   266\t- **Files changed**:\n   267\t  - Renamed `frontend/src/app/dashboard/` to `frontend/src/app/profile/`\n   268\t  - Updated links in `UrnExperience.js`, `LoginPage.js`\n   269\t  - Added redirect route at `frontend/src/app/dashboard/page.jsx`\n   270\t- **Rationale**: \"Profile\" is more intuitive than \"Dashboard\" for user settings\n   271\t\n   272\t#### Progress Stepper in LessonSidebar\n   273\t- **Change**: Added visual progress stepper showing 3 steps (Khám Phá, Bài Học, Trắc Nghiệm) with XP values\n   274\t- **Features**:\n   275\t  - Visual states: completed (green checkmark), current (pulsing primary), locked (gray lock)\n   276\t  - Connecting lines between steps\n   277\t  - XP display for each step (25, 50, 75)\n   278\t- **Files changed**: `frontend/src/components/LessonSidebar.js`\n   279\t- **Rationale**: Clear visual indication of learning progress and next actions\n   280\t\n   281\t