/FloatingNavbar.jsx`\n   316\t\n   317\t### Achievements Page (Task 1.2)\n   318\t- **Created**: `/achievements` page combining badges + leaderboard with tab navigation\n   319\t- **Features**: Tab switching, Vietnamese UI, responsive grid layout\n   320\t- **Files**: `frontend/src/app/achievements/page.jsx`\n   321\t\n   322\t### Dashboard → Profile Rename (Task 3.1)\n   323\t- **Renamed**: `/dashboard` → `/profile`\n   324\t- **Added**: Redirect from `/dashboard` to `/profile`\n   325\t- **Files changed**:\n   326\t  - `frontend/src/app/profile/` (renamed from dashboard)\n   327\t  - `frontend/src/components/UrnExperience.js`\n   328\t  - `frontend/src/components/LoginPage.js`\n   329\t\n   330\t### Motif Access Restriction (NEW - 2025-12-18)\n   331\t- **Implemented**: Undiscovered motifs cannot be accessed directly via URL or link\n   332\t- **Behavior**:\n   333\t  - Check `progressByMotifId` from motifStore\n   334\t  - If status is \"hidden\" or undefined, show error and redirect to `/explore`\n   335\t  - Users must discover motifs on 3D viewer before accessing lesson/quiz pages\n   336\t- **Files changed**:\n   337\t  - `frontend/src/app/motif/[motifId]/page.jsx` - added discovery check\n   338\t  - `frontend/src/app/motif/[motifId]/quiz/page.jsx` - added discovery check\n   339\t- **Pattern**: Client-side guard using Zustand store state + router redirect\n   340\t\n   341\t### Translation Files (Task 1.3)\n   342\t- **Created**: `frontend/src/translations/nav.json` with Vietnamese/English translations\n   343\t- **Content**: Navigation labels, tab labels, empty states, loading states\n   344\t\n   345\t## Additional AI Tools\n   346\t\n   347\tWhen working on this project, use specialized AI tools for different tasks:\n   348\t\n   349\t- **Codex CLI (`codex`)**: Use for main tasks requiring code generation, designing, and refactoring\n   350\t- **Gemini CLI (`gemini`)**: Use with model `gemini-3-pro-preview` (must be this exact model) for:\n   351\t  - Finding documentation\n   352\t  - Writing informational content\n   353\t  - Generating long text\n   354\t  - i18n translations\n   355\t  - UX specifications\n   356\t\n   357\tExample usage:\n   358\t```bash\n   359\t# Codex for code tasks\n   360\tcodex \"Refactor component X to use hooks\"\n   361\t\n   362\t# Gemini for content/docs\n   363\tgemini -m gemini-3.0-pro-preview \"Write Vietnamese translations for navigation items\"\n   364\t```\n   365\t\nTotal lines in file: 365\n"}
